menuconfig ZMK_SATELLITE
    bool "Send keyboard status to ZMK Satellite"
    depends on ZMK_BLE
    select ZMK_STATUS_ADVERTISEMENT if ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL || !ZMK_SPLIT
    select ZMK_SPLIT_BLE_CENTRAL_BATTERY_LEVEL_FETCHING if ZMK_SPLIT_BLE && ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    imply BT_BAS if ZMK_SPLIT && !ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    help
      Enable in a shared keyboard .conf. Only the central or standalone
      keyboard advertises; split peripherals retain battery reporting.
      Requires the module/west.yml import to fetch Prospector definitions.

if ZMK_SATELLITE && (ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL || !ZMK_SPLIT)

config ZMK_SATELLITE_ADV_INTERVAL_MS
    int "Status radio advertising interval (milliseconds)"
    range 100 10000
    default 100
    help
      100 preserves Prospector's default 100-150ms continuous status radio
      advertising. Other values set the own non-connectable status interval
      to this value (plus BLE random delay). They do not change ZMK's PC
      connection advertising or Prospector's split-discovery burst interval.
      This is NOT the 200ms/30s payload refresh interval.

config ZMK_SATELLITE_CENTRAL_SIDE
    string "Physical side of split central: AUTO, LEFT, RIGHT or AUX"
    default "AUTO"
    depends on ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    help
      AUTO uses the selected shield/board name's left/right suffix.
      Unrecognised layouts retain Prospector's configured central side;
      specify LEFT/RIGHT/AUX only if the automatic choice is inappropriate.

endif
